BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Triangle Board Games & Bars
UID:event_313259467@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260417T031827Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260418T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260418T190000
SUMMARY:Play Games at Gamers Geekery!
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Board Games and Bars\nOfficial event times are 4pm un
 til 7pm\, but you are welcome to stay as long as you want.\n\nHow it works
 . Come on in\, grab a name tag at the bar area\, find the tables that are 
 reserved for the Meetup group.\n\nThe $2.50 fee can be paid to the venue b
 y talking to any of the bartenders. Food and drinks are available at the b
 ar.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/triangle-board-games-and-bars/events/
 313259467/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260208T024915Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260208T024915Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Triangle Board Games & Bars
UID:event_314321656@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260417T031827Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260421T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260421T203000
SUMMARY:Cary Jaycees Monthly General Membership Meeting 
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Board Games and Bars\nThe are Cary Jaycees\, your loc
 al crew of young professionals who know how to blend community service wit
 h a whole lot of fun. If you’ve ever wanted to meet awesome people\, mak
 e a real impact\, or build your leadership skills while doing some serious
 ly cool projects\, this is your group. Some of our regular attendees don
 ’t RSVP so please don’t be discouraged if others haven’t RSVPd\n\nTh
 e Jaycees are always looking for new members\, so if you’ve been thinkin
 g about getting more involved in Cary and beyond\, consider this your sign
 . The Jaycees are an 18-40 year old group but we welcome everyone to be an
  alumni member (poorly named as you don't need to be a past member.) We me
 et on the third Tuesday of every month at Gamers Geekery and Tavern at 6:3
 0 PM and would love for you to stop by\, say hello\, and see what they’r
 e all about. We cover the game fee for anyone playing with us and will als
 o have appetizers to share.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/triangle-board-games-and-bars/events/
 314321656/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260416T202127Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260416T202127Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Triangle Board Games & Bars
UID:event_314112634@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260417T031827Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260423T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260423T230000
SUMMARY:Play Board Games at the Geekery
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Board Games and Bars\nCome play games at Gamers Geeke
 ry and Tavern every thursday night!\n\nStarting time is 6:30\, but feel fr
 ee to come in anytime and just hang out for the night. Group is very casua
 l and friendly.\n\nHow it works:\nCome on in\, grab a name tag and pay the
  $2.50 meetup participant fee at the bar area\, find the tables that are r
 eserved for the Meetup group\, play games with others who show up. Food an
 d drinks are available at the bar.\n\nPlease RSVP by noon day of. If less 
 than four people are able to attend a given Wednesday the event will be ca
 nceled.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/triangle-board-games-and-bars/events/
 314112634/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260403T225843Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260403T225843Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
